<title>UK: Wet Brent trades 13 cents weaker at July -62 cts.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades 13 cents weaker at July -62 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Dated Brent cargo loading June 17-19 traded at July Brent -62 cents on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>The trade was 13 cents down on a deal for a June 16-18 cargo done on Friday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
